# Test requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
#
# Every request now needs your login token. To get one:
#   1. Open the app in your browser and sign in.
#   2. Open the developer console (Cmd + Option + J in Chrome).
#   3. Run:  JSON.parse(localStorage["plate.tokens"]).accessToken
#   4. Paste the result below. Tokens expire after 1 hour.
#
# Don't commit your real URL or token.

@baseUrl = https://REPLACE_ME.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@today = 2026-10-11

### See a day's totals and progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/days/{{today}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set your daily goals
PUT {{baseUrl}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "calories": 2500,
  "protein_g": 150,
  "sleep_hours": 8,
  "reminders": true,
  "utc_offset_minutes": -240
}

### Log a meal
POST {{baseUrl}}/meals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "name": "Chicken, rice and broccoli", "calories": 650, "protein_g": 45 }

### Estimate a meal from a description (uses Bedrock, nothing is saved)
POST {{baseUrl}}/meals/parse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "3 eggs, 2 slices of toast and a protein shake" }

### Look up a food in the USDA database
GET {{baseUrl}}/foods/search?q=chicken breast cooked
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Look up a packaged food by barcode
GET {{baseUrl}}/barcode/737628064502
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Log an exercise
POST {{baseUrl}}/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "exercise": "Back squat", "sets": 5, "reps": 5, "weight": 225 }

### Log sleep (use the date you woke up)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sleep
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "hours": 7.5 }

### Last 7 days of insights
GET {{baseUrl}}/insights?end={{today}}&days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without a token this should fail with 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/days/{{today}}
